{"sections":[{"slug":"群胚","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"群胚"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"群胚"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">群胚是所有态射均为同构的范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">群胚可视为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">概念的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">元素可带有自同构</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的集合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这种推广的极致是</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群胚对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群胚对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> 1-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚是所有态射均为同构的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/严格1-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">一个严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚包含如下资料</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">集合</span> $G_1,G_0$,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>\n<ul>\n<li>$s,t\\colon G_1\\to G_0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">起点和终点</span>),</li>\n<li>$e\\colon G_0\\to G_1$ (<span lang=\"zh\">单位</span>),</li>\n<li>$i\\colon G_1\\to G_1$ (<span lang=\"zh\">逆</span>),</li>\n<li>$m\\colon G_1{_s\\times_t} G_1 \\to G_1$ (<span lang=\"zh\">纤维积上定义的乘法</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">注意</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">先走第二个箭头</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">再走第一个箭头</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>,</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">满足如下条件</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">乘法的起止</span>) $s\\circ m = s\\circ \\text{pr}_2$, $t\\circ m = t\\circ \\text{pr}_1$;</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">结合律</span>) …;</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">逆的起止</span>) $s\\circ i = t$, $t\\circ i = s$;</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">逆的性质</span>) $m\\circ (\\operatorname{id}_{G_1}\\times i)= e\\circ t$, $m\\circ (i\\times \\operatorname{id}_{G_1})= e\\circ s$;</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">单位的起止</span>) $s\\circ e= t\\circ e = \\operatorname{id}_{G_0}$;</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">单位的性质</span>) $m\\circ (e\\circ t\\times \\operatorname{id}_{G_1})=m\\circ (\\operatorname{id}_{G_1}\\times e\\circ s)=\\operatorname{id}_{G_1}$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}